{"id":"n64743-5-7","stage":1,"title":"바라보다 · 奔","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64743-5-7-1","ko":"저희 아버님은 아직도 테니스를 즐기세요.","zh":"我们父亲现在仍然很喜欢打网球。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"아버님은","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버님은","audio":"/audio/553b54b1b84194ac16c0.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"테니스를","meaning":"网球","explanation":"테니스：网球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"테니스","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37605","senseId":"1","lemma":"테니스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"테니스를","audio":"/audio/d8b610581e40497bda78.mp3"}},{"text":"즐기세요.","meaning":"喜欢，爱","explanation":"즐기다：喜欢，爱；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91878","senseId":"2","lemma":"즐기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐기세요","audio":"/audio/c10020882ef40738f1ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3","entryId":"71340","definition":"(尊称)用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버님"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"aa5ded493982a07e","term":"테니스","zh":"网球","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3","entryId":"37605","definition":"中间挂一道网，双方各据一边，用拍子来回打球而比胜负的运动比赛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"52a5578b574f2755","term":"즐기다","zh":"喜欢，爱","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3","entryId":"91878","definition":"喜爱做某事而经常做。","pronunciation":["즐기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4ef2ef3171dea82beaf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64743-5-7-2","ko":"여든을 바라보는 연세신데 정말 건강하시네요.","zh":"都快八十岁了，他还真健康啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여든을","meaning":"八十","explanation":"여든：八十；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여든","audio":"/audio/343cee874536d9eef8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93503","senseId":"1","lemma":"여든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여든을","audio":"/audio/164db08469e28b2b850d.mp3"}},{"text":"바라보는","meaning":"奔，临近，就要","explanation":"바라보다：奔，临近，就要；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"바라보다","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64743","senseId":"5","lemma":"바라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바라보는","audio":"/audio/7ae0304063a44bb95e5d.mp3"}},{"text":"연세신데","meaning":"贵庚","explanation":"연세：贵庚；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"연세","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14018","senseId":"1","lemma":"연세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연세신데","audio":"/audio/3b00ea6641fc87260eee.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],